<title>USA: E'town names Anne Evans Estabrook chairman.</title>
<headline>E'town names Anne Evans Estabrook chairman.</headline>
<dateline>WESTFIELD, N.J. 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>E'town Corp said its board has voted to elect Anne Evans Estabrook and Andrew Chapman to fill the positions of chairman and president, respectively, effective May 15.</p>
<p>It said Estabrook and Chapman will succeed the retiring chairman Robert Kean Jr and president Henry Patterson II.</p>
<p>Estabrook has been a vice president of E'town since 1985. Chapman is president of Elizabeth Water Co, E'town's principle operating unit and will continue in that role.</p>
</text>
